  "description": "Fine curb revision: output plane-residual and spatial-support gates plus measured endpoint continuations. Original thin-curb fixture remains unchanged. Five frame-91 removals are user-labeled false positives; other changes are geometric inferences, not exhaustive ground truth. The frame-832 competing-edge revision rejects the ten labeled false positives and recovers vicinity of the true right curb. Changes on frames 350, 650 and 775 are geometric inferences without new labels. The follow-up replaces conflicted global refits with local ridge maxima connected by mutually compatible tangents. Both 28-point follow-up groups must lie within 0.06 m of measured boundary segments and 0.10 m of actual selected returns; all 23 reported false positives are excluded.",
